  "feedback": "Something cool to think about -- if an animation was run `when animated` could mean \"wait for the animated event, then do...\"  Assumes the animation is a promise.\n\nLook through the list and call out inconsistencies.\nIn general, it's better to reuse terms for analagous things.  Also \"folding\" is a programmer concept, \"showing and hiding\" are people concepts."
